tted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Whole lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remaining fibroadipose tissue  Received in formalin  labeled  posterior margin right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue with a stitch on one surface designating the new margin  The surface containing the stitch is inked black  specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  superior margin right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm portion of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue with a stitch on one surface designating the new margin  The surface containing the stitch is inked black  specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  lateral margin right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue with a stitch on one surface  The surface containing the stitch is inked black  specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  anterior margin right breast   are two portions of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue which measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The larger fragment contains a stitch on one surface designating the new margin  The surface containing the stitch is inked black  specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Smaller fragment  bisected   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Larger fragment  serially sectioned  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION   1  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   SENTINEL    334   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT NON SENTINEL   