ing breast parenchyma contains several ill defined fibrotic areas  the largest of which measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  located in the lower inner quadrant  extending to within 1 5cm of the closest deep margin and 2 0cm of the closest inferomedial soft tissue margin  In addition  a REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fibrotic biopsy cavity surrounded by bright yellow breast parenchyma is identified subjacent to the skin scar  located 3cm from the deep margin and 8cm from the superior margin  The attached axillary tail is dissected to reveal multiple  tan  ovoid  soft lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  Section code  A  nipple B  skin with scar and underlying biopsy cavity C D firm area with closest deep resection margin E J firm area  representative sections K M fibrotic area  representative sections N R lymph nodes Resident  STAMATINA KAPTAIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Andrew Louis Warshaw  M D  Vikram S Kashyap  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    AXILLA  LEFT  , Checked.
