ked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 14 37 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a 2 8x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm fragment of breast  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a 0 8cm firm  well circumscribed nodule abutting the inked margin  The nodule is submitted in casettes A and B  The remainders are submitted entirely in cassettes C and D  Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  LEFT   HIGHLY SUSPICIOUS NODULE TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  Joseph Misdraji  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY    report_end  , Unchecked.
