r approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  30 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 13 56     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block C   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates HER 2 neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Rosemary Tambouret MD Signed On  06 MAY 04 at 16 20 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast long lateral  short superior  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibrofatty tissue with a short suture designating the superior aspect and a long suture designating the lateral aspect  There is a localization wire in place  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior is black  the medial is green and the lateral aspect is yellow  respectively  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm ill defined  irregular glistening tan gray to pink  gelatinous and soft mass located 0 9cm from the superior margin  0 4cm from the posterior  0 5cm from the lateral  0 6cm from the medial  0 9cm from the anterior and 2 3cm from the inferior margins respectively  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma is tan yellow to pink  lobulated and unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted sequentially from superior to inferior in cassettes A F with the entire mass in cassettes C D and the superior margin in cassette A  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right axillary sentinel lymph node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular tan yellow nodular fibrofatty portion of soft tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted for frozen as FX 1  now as G  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right axillary non sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm irregular tan pink rubbery lymph node which is bisected  and entirely submitted in cassette H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast final shaved margin  stitch at new margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated and focally hemorrhagic portion of fibrofatty tissue with a suture along one aspect designating the new margin  The sutured new margin is inked black  the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable tan yellow to pink cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I P  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  NORMA RODRIGUEZ  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  ESTHER OLIVA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL  EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  LYMPH NODE RIGHT AXILLA NON SENTINEL  EXCISION PART D  BREAST RIGHT FINAL MARGIN  EXCISION , Unchecked.
